Question.TranslatedText:
The Choir Body Map comes in a bunch of flavors:

@IMAGEMAP=CHOIRBODYMAP_MALE (standard)
@IMAGEMAP=CHOIRBODYMAP_MALE_ORIENT (includes new orientation tags front/back left/right)
@IMAGEMAP=CHOIRBODYMAP_MALE_OPTIONS (shows the checkbox options so you can click that way)
@IMAGEMAP=CHOIRBODYMAP_MALE_OPTIONS_ORIENT (shows checkbox options AND orientation flags)
@IMAGEMAP=CHOIRBODYMAP_MALE_NO_ALT (like standard, but doesn't include mouse-over text labels)

You can replace MALE with FEMALE for the female version.  Typically you include male and female and show the version as determined by branching logic from a previous question.

Check below to preview:

